invalid type: string "Title: VPN Troubleshooting Guide\n\nProblem:\nUsers receive a VPN connection timeout error while trying to connect to the corporate network.\n\nPossible Causes:\n- Poor internet connection\n- Incorrect VPN credentials\n- Firewall blocking VPN traffic\n\nResolution:\n1. Verify internet connection.\n2. Restart the VPN client.\n3. Verify username and password.\nA'Mÿhÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿ